[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2160.95, "timestamp": "00:36:00", "text": "こんな感じになります。 しかし、なぜ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2167.109, "timestamp": "00:36:07", "text": "ええ、まだ設定していません。 私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2172.79, "timestamp": "00:36:12", "text": "その企業の認証など、あらゆることをしなければならない。 見た目は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2174.95, "timestamp": "00:36:14", "text": "こんな感じです。 好きな"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2176.87, "timestamp": "00:36:16", "text": "金額を入力できます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2179.589, "timestamp": "00:36:19", "text": "通貨を変更できるかどうかは分かりません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2181.109, "timestamp": "00:36:21", "text": "えーと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2185.19, "timestamp": "00:36:25", "text": "基本的には、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2190.069, "timestamp": "00:36:30", "text": "Polar に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2197.03, "timestamp": "00:36:37", "text": "Stripe があるかどうかはわかりません。 そうだと思います。 でも、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2202.55, "timestamp": "00:36:42", "text": "Stripeで支払いをしたい場合は、ストリームを"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2204.71, "timestamp": "00:36:44", "text": "待ってください、私の支払いリンクは何でしたっけ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2207.829, "timestamp": "00:36:47", "text": "？  1秒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2213.589, "timestamp": "00:36:53", "text": "Twitch パネルを確認しないと、Surya が Twitch にいます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2215.91, "timestamp": "00:36:55", "text": "こんにちは。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2218.55, "timestamp": "00:36:58", "text": "暗号通貨に関してはお手伝いできます。"}]